==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use some bulky cats like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] and his [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed counterpart]] for the Kory/Camelle wave. You should also get [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark cats]] like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] for the Shadow Boxer K wave.

